\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {S.7}{\ignorespaces As the compactness figure of the article (Sect.~3.1), but the symbols in panel (a) are raw E-class fractions among E/S-classified satellites in 0.2-dex bins of \(\log \langle R_{ij}\rangle \), with 95\% intervals from a bootstrap of physical hosts. The lines in panel (a) are logistic fits evaluated at \(\log (M_\star /M_\odot ) = 10.35\). Panel (b) shows the model contrast as a function of separation within the shared range (94--219~kpc) alongside the full-sample and matched contrasts.}}{7}{figure.7}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:supp_compactness_raw}{{S.7}{7}{As the compactness figure of the article (Sect.~3.1), but the symbols in panel (a) are raw E-class fractions among E/S-classified satellites in 0.2-dex bins of \(\log \langle R_{ij}\rangle \), with 95\% intervals from a bootstrap of physical hosts. The lines in panel (a) are logistic fits evaluated at \(\log (M_\star /M_\odot ) = 10.35\). Panel (b) shows the model contrast as a function of separation within the shared range (94--219~kpc) alongside the full-sample and matched contrasts}{figure.7}{}}
